            <ArticleTitle>[Effect of various cardiac glycosides on central hemodynamics after operations on the abdominal organs].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>107-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors estimated the influence of corglycon, strophanthin and digoxin on the central hemodynamics indices. Corglycon is recommended for use in urgent situations, while digoxin should be used for prophylactics of cardiac insufficiency.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
